  - leaderboard evaluation
abstract: >-
  Code and judgment data for "Do LLM-Judge Biases Compose? A Label-Free,
  Scale-Aware Test for Position-Length Interaction". Includes the
  Swap-Symmetry Interaction Test (SSIT), the pilot analysis with
  swap-equivariant tie coding, stimulus-clustered inference and curvature
  baselines (analyze_tmlr.py), Interaction-Aware Swap Correction (IASC),
  the simulations behind the paper's tables, and a multi-provider
  judgment collector.
